            "text": "Questions before you join",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Something else? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Write to us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/book-a-call\">book a call</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much space do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>A spot that gets four or more hours of direct sun. A balcony of two square metres is enough for the whole course. If you have less sun, module five covers what grows in shade.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much will the garden itself cost?",
            "answer": "<p>Most students spend between $60 and $150 on pots or a bed, compost and seeds in the first year. The first module lists exactly what to buy for your space, and what to skip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where I live has a different season. Does it still work?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The planting calendar works from your last frost date, which you look up in lesson one. The class dates follow a northern spring; if yours is later, start the modules when your calendar says.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live call?",
            "answer": "<p>Every call is recorded and added to the course the same day. You can send your question beforehand and Maren answers it on the recording.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>For as long as the course exists. Lessons, recordings and printables stay in your account, and updates are free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pay in parts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout choose three monthly payments instead of one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us within 30 days of joining and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
